=== Page Allocation Tests ===

These tests verify mulle_mmap_alloc_pages() functionality:
1. Single page allocation and deallocation
2. Multiple page allocation and deallocation
3. Various page size multiples
4. Non-page-aligned allocation sizes

=== Test: Single Page Allocation ===

System page size: 65536 bytes
Phase 1: Allocating single page
  SUCCESS: Allocated 65536 bytes
Phase 2: Testing zero-filled guarantee
  SUCCESS: All 65536 bytes are zero-filled
Phase 3: Testing write access
  SUCCESS: Page is writable and readable
Phase 4: Freeing page
  SUCCESS: Page freed successfully
Test completed successfully

=== Test: Multiple Page Allocation ===

Allocating 4 pages (262144 bytes total)
Phase 1: Allocating multiple pages
  SUCCESS: Allocated 262144 bytes
Phase 2: Testing zero-filled guarantee across all pages
  SUCCESS: All 262144 bytes across 4 pages are zero-filled
Phase 3: Testing write access across all pages
  SUCCESS: All 4 pages are writable and readable
Phase 4: Freeing pages
  SUCCESS: Pages freed successfully
Test completed successfully

